<section id="features" class="section-separator-bottom bg-night-gradient px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 md:px-10 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <h2 class="section-heading">
      Every surface, native
    </h2>
    <p class="section-intro mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-night-soft-text sm:text-lg">
      Notes, chat, files, calendar, projects, tasks, diagrams, rooms. All built into
      Uniffy itself. All permission-aware. All wired into the same mention graph.
      No bolt-ons, no marketplace bots, no copy-paste between tools.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:mt-16 lg:auto-rows-[16rem] lg:grid-cols-12">

      <article class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-night-hairline bg-night-soft p-6 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-8 lg:row-span-2">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-60 w-60 rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md border border-accent/55 bg-accent/10 text-accent">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M229.66,58.34l-32-32a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,0l-96,96A8,8,0,0,0,88,128v32a8,8,0,0,0,8,8h32a8,8,0,0,0,5.66-2.34l96-96A8,8,0,0,0,229.66,58.34ZM124.69,152H104V131.31l64-64L188.69,88ZM200,76.69,179.31,56,192,43.31,212.69,64ZM224,128v80a16,16,0,0,1-16,16H48a16,16,0,0,1-16-16V48A16,16,0,0,1,48,32h80a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H48V208H208V128a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-night-text">Notes</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-night-faint">Markdown &middot; live cursors &middot; embedded mentions</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative mt-5 flex flex-1 flex-col rounded-xl border border-night-hairline bg-night p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/30">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <h4 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold leading-tight text-night-text">Architecture decisions log</h4>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-night-faint">
                <span class="text-violet-400">Teddy</span> editing &middot; saved 12s ago &middot; v37
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex shrink-0 -space-x-2">
              <span class="grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[9px] font-bold text-white ring-2 ring-night">TI</span>
              <span class="grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-[9px] font-bold text-white ring-2 ring-night">GA</span>
              <span class="grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-violet-500 text-[9px] font-bold text-white ring-2 ring-night">TI</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-night-soft-text">
            <p>
              We picked
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 align-baseline font-mono text-[11px] text-violet-300">
                <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M227.32 73.37 182.63 28.69a16 16 0 0 0-22.63 0L36.69 152a15.86 15.86 0 0 0-4.69 11.31V208a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h44.69a15.86 15.86 0 0 0 11.31-4.69L227.32 96a16 16 0 0 0 0-22.63Z"/></svg>
                Roadmap Q3 2026
              </span>
              as the canonical source over a chat thread.
            </p>
            <p>
              Trade-off was discoverability vs velocity. Background read:
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 align-baseline font-mono text-[11px] text-blue-300">
                <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M213.66 82.34 173.66 42.34A8 8 0 0 0 168 40H72a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v144a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h128a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V88a8 8 0 0 0-2.34-5.66Z"/></svg>
                ConnectRPC RFC.pdf
              </span>
            </p>
            <p>
              Owner of schema federation going forward? Pinging
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 align-baseline font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-300">
                @Teddy Ivanova
              </span>
              for input before Thursday review.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-[13px]">
              <li>Lock the schema once federation owner is confirmed.</li>
              <li>Migrate the egress workers to the new contract by Friday.</li>
              <li>
                Ship behind a flag, gated by
                <span class="rounded bg-night-band px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-night-text">FEATURE_FEDERATED_SCHEMA</span>.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="inline-block h-3.5 w-[2px] animate-pulse bg-violet-400"></span>
              <span class="rounded-md bg-violet-500/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-violet-300">Teddy</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-night-band px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">
              <span class="text-night-faint">#</span>adr
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-night-band px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">
              <span class="text-night-faint">#</span>backend
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-night-band px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">
              <span class="text-night-faint">#</span>q3
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 border-t border-night-hairline pt-3">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-night-faint">Comments &middot; 2</p>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-[8px] font-bold text-white">GA</span>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[9px]"><span class="font-semibold text-night-text">Georgi</span> <span class="text-night-faint">2m ago</span></p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] leading-snug text-night-soft-text">Happy to own federation. Rolling out a draft proposal in <span class="font-mono text-violet-300">@AGT-12</span>.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[8px] font-bold text-white">TI</span>
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[9px]"><span class="font-semibold text-night-text">Teddy</span> <span class="text-night-faint">just now</span></p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] leading-snug text-night-soft-text">Done. Locking the schema after review on <span class="font-mono text-rose-300">@Q3 Planning sync</span>.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-night-hairline bg-night-soft p-6 lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md border border-accent/55 bg-accent/10 text-accent">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M173.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,1,0,11.32l-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-24-24a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35A8,8,0,0,1,173.66,98.34ZM224,48V208a16,16,0,0,1-16,16H48a16,16,0,0,1-16-16V48A16,16,0,0,1,48,32H208A16,16,0,0,1,224,48ZM208,208V48H48V208H208Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-night-text">Tasks &amp; projects</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-night-faint">Kanban &middot; ownership &middot; due dates</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
          <div class="rounded-md border border-night-hairline bg-night p-2">
            <p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-night-faint">To do</p>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="rounded bg-night-band px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">DLQ wiring</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-night-band px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">Dashboard</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-blue-500/30 bg-night p-2">
            <p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400">In progress</p>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="rounded border-l-2 border-blue-500 bg-night-band px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-night-soft-text">Egress retries</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-night-hairline bg-night p-2">
            <p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Done</p>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="rounded bg-night-band px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-night-faint line-through">Schema lock</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-night-band px-1.5 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-night-faint line-through">Worker pool</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-night-hairline bg-night-soft p-6 lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md border border-accent/55 bg-accent/10 text-accent">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M208,32H184V24a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v8H88V24a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v8H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,48V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H208a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V48A16,16,0,0,0,208,32ZM72,48v8a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V48h80v8a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V48h24V80H48V48ZM208,208H48V96H208V208Zm-68-76a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,140,132Zm44,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,184,132ZM96,172a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,96,172Zm44,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,140,172Zm44,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,184,172Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-night-text">Calendar</p>
